 \u00a0 \u00a0 and skill effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access helpful data on Hero contributions to aid your deck building. Create your very own unique Hero deck.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy between your Heroes and the Goddesses is crucial in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Strategy\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853110/extras/044f59f589e48cf9c121e4dc66cd015a.poster.avif?t=1767679436\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853110/extras/044f59f589e48cf9c121e4dc66cd015a.webm?t=1767679436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853110/extras/044f59f589e48cf9c121e4dc66cd015a.mp4?t=1767679436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty dynamically changes with every choice you make as you progress through the stages.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather information and fill your Codex to see the traits between Heroes and Goddesses, then use this knowledge to develop your own strategies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize events and shops offering a variety of effects to turn battles in your favor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CQ LABS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853110/acd7523438d8df7d3bfa44243b42f2f05f30e0e3/header.jpg?t=